17417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>With her powerful snipping ability Scarlet will do single target heavy damage to anyone trying to steal your &quot;merchandise&quot; <br></li><li> <strong><u>Pete the crazy bomber</u></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845290/extras/f14017a1acacb0060a52897357131932.poster.avif?t=1667817417\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845290/extras/f14017a1acacb0060a52897357131932.webm?t=1667817417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Heavy area damage is to be expected from Pete. But why Crazy? Can he be trusted?? what will happen if something goes wrong with his contraptions? </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Playability</h2>This is a &quot;never ending&quot; game. <br>Everytime you play it, you will get a unique experience, since the events, the prices and the drops will be different.",
